{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"zhuge-p0006","name":"崔州平","evidence":["zhuge-q-o004"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhuge-m-o004-zhuge-p0006","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhuge-q-o004"]},{"id":"zhuge-m-p003-zhuge-p0006","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhuge-q-p003"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhuge-q-o004","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-0e9752d1cfebda9f62cc","layer":"original","quote":"时人莫之许也〖9〗，惟博陵崔州平、颍川徐庶元直与亮友善，谓为信然〖10〗。﹝三﹞时先主屯新野。徐庶见先主，先主器之〖11〗；谓先主曰：“诸葛孔明者，卧龙也〖12〗。将军岂愿见之乎〖13〗？”﹝四﹞先主曰：“君与俱来！”庶曰：“此人可就见〖14〗，不可屈致也〖15〗：将军宜枉驾顾之〖16〗！”","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":146},{"id":"zhuge-q-p003","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-5b0387b2cca0f13524e2","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞按《崔氏谱》：州平，太尉烈子，均之弟也。","attribution":"《崔氏谱》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":25,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-e40ccd03a9bef78547a3","start":0,"end":23}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
